        "zh-cn": "支持矩阵、bounded语义及快照replace/append与增量upsert区分保持。复核continuous提交、租约恢复、诊断、停止清理与扫描的权威正文引用；Oracle及运行限制保留。写后仅扫目标表，创建仍禁扫描，不扩业务Kafka、watermark或停止态native创建，不把观测或声明当运行验收。",
        "en": "The matrix, bounded semantics and snapshot replace/append versus incremental upsert remain. Reviewed canonical references for continuous commits, leases/recovery, diagnostics, stop/cleanup and scans preserve Oracle/runtime limits. Post-write scans target only; creation disables scans. No expansion of business Kafka, watermark or stopped native creation, and no runtime proof from observations or declarations."
      }
