        "zh-cn": "本次增加 Agent 内批准／拒绝、刷新不重发、零直接启动／扫描和不跳转的受控浏览器断言；原创建复核继续保留。",
        "en": "Adds controlled-browser assertions for inline approve/reject, no refresh replay, no direct start/scan and no navigation, while retaining creation review coverage."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "role_protection",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/service/role_protection_service.go",
      "anchor": "func (s *TaskService) validateRoleTask(",
      "commit": "d01c5772f84d19c74010d1bd048433c8000d85be",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "角色方式保存只消费当前第一方 User 的角色事实；无选择直接返回。角色手动执行需独立 EA，不赋予委托创建运行权。",
        "en": "Role-choice saves consume only current first-party User role facts; absent choices return directly. Manual role execution requires separate EA and does not grant delegated creation execution rights."
      },
      "sha256": "74cb68a5a297a1a725435729625ba73c988cc22d1782dca92735af286d064b85"
    },
    {
      "id": "current_user_roles",
      "owner": "common",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "common/client/system_current_subject_roles.go",
      "anchor": "func (c *SystemServiceClient) ResolveCurrentSubjectRoles(",
      "commit": "50446c02787d75857e83987ce4c872ca5d406145",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "本人角色读取要求未到期第一方 Tenant User，拒绝 Delegated／Service，不替换服务令牌、不保存凭据；不授予数据或执行权限。",
        "en": "Current role reads require a live first-party Tenant User and reject Delegated/Service identities without substituting service tokens or retaining credentials; no data or execution permission is granted."
      },
      "sha256": "e213a8e4bd66e48b7759ab025dfb26305cd73df875a1d3726ba6a42e65cf35e4"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirmation_resume",
      "owner": "agent",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "agent/backend/services/runs.py",
      "anchor": "async def resume_agent_run(",
      "commit": "dee60ec6b170ea58858266922751eb13d8bd091b",
      "sha256": "ecab0bd6863b07f84077a1d8fee2e9cbaab3571a1a9a858f6b694ed79d541513",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "本次仅从已完成正式 Owner Interaction 写入运行确认引用，普通文本清除该引用；原创建消费与失败屏障保持。",
        "en": "Run confirmation references come only from a completed formal owner interaction and are cleared by ordinary text; existing creation consumption and failure barriers remain."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "batch_boundary_test",
      "owner": "agent",
      "kind": "test",
      "path": "agent/backend/tests/test_agent_factory_events.py",
      "anchor": "async def test_search_failure_stops_without_retry_enumeration_or_write(",
      "commit": "dee60ec6b170ea58858266922751eb13d8bd091b",
      "sha256": "9b6f14952b99ab54068ae2a94007a21dd657263bb74ec7e455d232ad4f2686cc",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "受控批次夹具显式传入创建能力；搜索失败不得重试、枚举或写入等原断言保持。",
        "en": "Controlled batch fixtures explicitly select creation capability; original no-retry, no-enumeration and no-write assertions after search failure remain."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "batch_contract",
      "owner": "agent",
      "kind": "normative",
      "path": "docs/spec/addp智能体Tool开放规范.md",
      "anchor": "同批 Tool 按模型返回顺序进入唯一 Runtime 调用路径",
      "commit": "66e6556daea0df4eca311ef2f2dd35fe55f176c2",
      "sha256": "b128e88046ae3f6c8983028a117b6f16cfbe45677f6a7e96f494aab5dfadcc93",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "本次规定独立运行／读取 Tool、用户手动 Owner 审批与确定性恢复，并按已选能力收窄白名单；创建／预检仍不授运行权。",
        "en": "Defines separate run/read tools, manual User owner approval and deterministic resume, with tools narrowed by selected capability; creation/precheck still confer no run authority."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "owner_precheck",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/service/task_config_check.go",
      "anchor": "func (s *TaskConfigCheckService) Check(",
      "commit": "6622b57e7bbc055bf6afb0e9a81e435ed089b076",
      "sha256": "85d7ad96066628ac6ba1cd2654a974f6d3570ed4fcf9d7c7d702be7e28f66ba4",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "只用已保存完整／采样结构检查目标 Provider；保留确定反证，采样正向赋值降为 unknown，无有效快照不补造源类型；不读取业务行。",
        "en": "Checks target Provider rules from persisted complete or sampled schemas, retaining contradictions but keeping sampled assignments unknown; no invented unobserved types or business-row reads."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "precheck_transform",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/executor/table_definition.go",
      "anchor": "func TransformTableDefinition(",
      "commit": "6622b57e7bbc055bf6afb0e9a81e435ed089b076",
      "sha256": "feed5566c3b11e16a8df0c7ff962941b3c010a78b49ce9581cf8671aa6c115df",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "映射后保留源字段及元素类型的已观察事实，不继承采样目标约束；未观察字段仍未知，跟随既有字段映射主链路。",
        "en": "Preserves observed source and element types through mapping without inheriting sampled target constraints; unobserved fields stay unknown on the existing mapping path."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "owner_precheck_test",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "test",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/service/task_config_check_test.go",
      "anchor": "func TestConfigCheckMongoObservedArrayMismatchIsNotHiddenBySampleCoverage(",
      "commit": "6622b57e7bbc055bf6afb0e9a81e435ed089b076",
      "sha256": "855a3da534f5ea3abcb76a59b1d07208562e20a251c3e267fad542515d48f5a6",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "纯 Mongo 投影别名到 PostgreSQL 定义检查：对象／数字数组拒绝；字符串、未知元素、JSON、复杂查询及未观察快照保留 unknown，诊断绑定映射位置且不改事实。",
        "en": "Pure Mongo projection aliases reach PostgreSQL definition checking: object/numeric arrays reject; strings, unknown elements, JSON, complex queries and unobserved snapshots stay unknown; locations remain bound and facts unchanged."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "precheck_transform_test",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "test",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/executor/table_definition_test.go",
      "anchor": "func TestTransformDefinitionIncompleteSourceDoesNotInventNullOrInheritedConstraints(",
      "commit": "6622b57e7bbc055bf6afb0e9a81e435ed089b076",
      "sha256": "abb0774e3156545a246c551ffda4075e296ffd4d68f159b9ef28afca88cc53d9",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "验证采样源反证保留、不成为目标类型／精度约束，未观察字段不变成确定 NULL，原始字段映射来源保持。",
        "en": "Verifies sampled counterexamples survive without becoming target type/precision constraints; unobserved fields never become known NULL and mapping provenance is preserved."
      }
    }
  ],
